blurb = "Depicts a scene from act 8 of the Tale of the 47 Ronin.

In this part of the story, Wakasa's Wife Tonase journeys with her daughter Konami from Edo to Yamashima in search of Yuranosuke's son Rikiya, hoping to reaffirm the betrothal of the young couple amidst the tragic fallout of their clan's downfall.

In the print, the two women are walking on a hilly path, in front of a huge pine tree, wreathed in an autumn-colored ivy. A woman is crouched to tie Konami's sandal. Behind them is their porter and another traveler, mounted on a horse.

In the background, over a wooded hill, is Mount Fuji, white against a blue sky."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
